                f"{'🔴 TRIGGERED — recession signal historically reliable with ≤1 false positive since 1970.' if _curr_sahm >= 0.50 else ('🟡 Watch zone — approaching trigger.' if _curr_sahm >= 0.25 else '🟢 Below watch threshold.')}"
